schema: claim-evidence
object:
  title: Ethereum Security QF round (Apr 23-May 14 2026) — Giveth's largest matching pool
  type: claim-evidence
  claim: >-
    "The Ethereum Security QF round (April 23 to May 14, 2026) ran a
    637.4274 ETH matching pool, Giveth's largest ever, drawing $315,020 in
    community donations across 13,805 transactions from 3,934 unique donors
    across 134 projects."
  evidence: >-
    Cited to the Giveth Forum results thread, "Ethereum Security QF Round
    Results, Apr, May 2026" (forum.giveth.io), listed in the article's References.
  source_lineage: "src/content/docs/giveth-donations.md, References: forum.giveth.io Ethereum Security QF Round Results thread"
  interpretation: >-
    A specific, sourced, quantitative result reported directly from Giveth's
    own forum post-round summary; used in the article to make Giveth's
    quadratic-funding scale claim concrete rather than abstract.
  uncertainty: >-
    Single-source figure (Giveth's own forum announcement), not
    independently cross-checked at ingestion time; describes one historical
    round and should not be read as typical or ongoing round size.
  maturity: raw
  ai_assisted: true
  provenance:
    origin: src/content/docs/giveth-donations.md
    transformation: quoted
